adele gets candid about her weight loss  specifically how she lost 100 pounds and  the public's reaction to it  the grammy winner shocked fans back in  2020 when she posted this pic to  instagram on her 32nd birthday rocking a  little black dress the pic gained more  than 12 million likes and almost a  quarter million comments mostly about  her physique it looks really amazing now  the hello singer is opening up about  losing 100 pounds in both the british  and american issues of vogue telling the  mag that she lost the weight over the  course of two years and she started  working out to curb her anxiety quote it  was never about losing weight it was  always about becoming stronger and  giving myself as much time every day  without my phone i got quite addicted to  it i work out two or three times a day  absolutely yeah adele's routine she'll  lift weights in the morning hike or box  in the afternoon and do cardio at night  but she insists she isn't and never has  been on a diet quote if anything i eat  more than i used to because i work out  so hard i feel amazing about it adele  says people were shocked she didn't  share her weight loss journey along the  way or try to get sponsorship deals out  of it she reacts quite bluntly telling  the mag i couldn't give a flying i did  it for myself and not anyone else so why  would i ever share it i don't find it  fascinating it's my body but the public  was fascinated with adele's weight loss  and adele admits that a lot of the  chatter was hurtful i don't even know  why to be honest i don't get it quote i  understand why it's a shock i understand  why some women especially were hurt  visually i represented a lot of women  but i'm still the same person and the  worst part of the whole thing was that  the most brutal conversations were being  had by other women about my body i was  very disappointed with that that hurt my  feelings but adele wants her fans to  know this body positivity comes in all  shapes and sizes  quote you don't need to be overweight to  be body positive you can be any shape or  size knowing adele all that conviction  will be channeled into her new music  earlier this week she dropped a teaser  for her latest single easy on me  the british singer tells the mag it's  sensitive for me this record justin how  much i love it i always say that 21  doesn't belong to me anymore everyone  else took it into their hearts so much  i'm not letting go of this one this is  my album i want to share myself with  everyone but i don't think i'll ever let  this one go
 

